Create a Task That Runs Every 15 Minutes (24/7):

	Step 1: Open Task Scheduler
          Press Win + R
          Type: taskschd.msc
          Press Enter
Step 2: Create a New Task
          On the right side → Click Create Task…
          	General Tab
                Name: EX: (Program Every 15 Minutes)
                
                Choose the options:
      
                Run whether user is logged on or not
                Run with highest privileges

Step 3: Triggers Tab
        Click New…
        Under Begin the task: On a schedule
        
        
        Set:
           Start: (any time)
  
          Settings: Daily
          
          
          Repeat task every:
           👉 Select 15 minutes
          
          
          For a duration of:
           👉 Select Indefinitely

        Click OK

Step 4: Actions
          Add your program/script the same way:

          Start a program
          Select .bat file

Step 5: Save
        Click OK

        Enter  password

📌 Your program will now run every 15 minutes continuously.
